<header class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-20 min-h-screen">
  <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-7xl font-mono tracking-tighter leading-[1.1] mb-6 md:mt-6 text-gray-900">
    Lost in<span class="p-8 flex justify-end items-end hover:text-blue-500 xl:text-8xl">translation.</span>
    <span class="text-gray-600 line-through decoration-blue-500 decoration-[4px] md:mt-0 md:text-4xl xl:text-5xl">Subtle art of confusion.</span><br/>
  </h1>
  
  <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-xl leading-relaxed mt-8">
    Essays and notes. Lest you forget. 
    <span class="block mt-2 text-sm text-gray-800 italic">
      (Expect 1 visual for every 200 words of rambling.)
    </span>
  </p>
</header>